# Camera system for the walker example (#548).
#
# CameraState (rig + camera + scene light + Hosek dataset) and cameraUpdate,
# extracted from app.rae with behaviour unchanged. cameraUpdate runs the same
# operations in the same order as before; it returns a small CameraTick because
# the touch-stick state it computes (updateWalkerTouch) is consumed by character
# movement AND the camera-moved flag drives the render decision. joyActive is
# really input's business — it rides here until #545 splits input out. Example-
# 114 files are siblings that merge into one module, so App/CharacterState/the
# focus-Z consts (character.rae) and the stdlib helpers all resolve cross-file.

